    "- `DATA_DIR`, `RAW_DATA_DIR`, `PROCESSED_DATA_DIR`, `RESULTS_DIR`: Directory paths\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note**: Weekly data (`interval='1wk'`) is used to align with weekly portfolio rebalancing frequency in the RL system.\n"
   ]
